    "enUS": {
      "description": "We need to try the Fool's Stout on one of the pit crews.  If you want to try it on the gnomes, then here -- take the stout and give it to the gnome pit boss.\n\nAnd don't wait too long.  This stout will go bad eventually.",
      "summary": "Bring the Fool's Stout to the Gnome Pit Boss.",
      "title": "Get the Gnomes Drunk",
